ndles `completionItem/resolve` requests that are sent by the client after the user selects\na completion item that was provided by `textDocument/completion`. Resolving the item fills the\n`detail?` field of the item with the pretty-printed type.\nThis control flow is necessary because pretty-printing the type for every single completion item\n(even those never selected by the user) is inefficient.\n","docLink":"./Lean/Server/FileWorker/RequestHandling.html#Lean.Server.FileWorker.handleCompletionItemResolve","kind":"def","line":55,"name":"Lean.Server.FileWorker.handleCompletionItemResolve","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/11acb17ec6b07a8f9e9173e6845197929540936b/src/Lean/Server/FileWorker/RequestHandling.lean#L55-L76"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Server/FileWorker/RequestHandling.html#Lean.Server.FileWorker.handleCompletion\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Server</span>.<span class=\"name\">FileWorker</span>.<span class=\"name\">handleCompletion</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">p</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Data/Lsp/LanguageFeatures.html#Lean.Lsp.CompletionParams\">Lsp.CompletionParams</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Server/Requests.html#Lean.Server.RequestM\">RequestM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Lean/Server/Requests.html#Lean.Server.RequestTask\">RequestTask</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Data/Lsp/LanguageFeatures.html#Lean.Lsp.ResolvableCompletionList\">Lsp.ResolvableCompletionList</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Server/FileWorker/RequestHandling.html#Lean.Server.FileWorker.handleCompletion","kind":"def","line":44,"name":"Lean.Server.FileWorker.handleCompletion","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/11acb17ec6b07a8f9e9173e684519